WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.700
Modulo starts with a portfolio dashboard for occupancy, rates,
revenue, and market context.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.700
AI prioritizes high-impact moves using revenue goals
and elasticity.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:18.000
Operators review the rules, guardrails, and proposed rate
before anything changes.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.700
Competitive context compares nearby care-adjusted rates.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:29.900
Analytics measures rate growth, occupancy, and revenue,
turning results into the next decision.